    {
      "text": "Vitamin D also plays a role in the nervous system, helping nerves transmit messages between the brain and the body.",
      "sources": [1, 2]
    },
    {
      "text": "Muscle function depends on vitamin D, as it is needed for muscles to move properly.",
      "sources": [1, 2]
    },
    {
      "text": "The immune system uses vitamin D to help fight off bacteria and viruses.",
